WEBVTT

00:12.480 --> 00:13.800
Thank you, Sister Wan'er

00:13.880 --> 00:16.040
Risking yourself to save us, mother and son

00:16.120 --> 00:17.040
A transaction

00:17.200 --> 00:18.600
Each has their needs

00:21.200 --> 00:22.960
But I cannot go with you

00:23.040 --> 00:24.360
Why?

00:24.440 --> 00:25.440
I am Prince Ning's

00:25.520 --> 00:28.187
Most important trump card to threaten Your Highness

00:29.080 --> 00:31.413
If the prince and I both disappear

00:31.520 --> 00:32.920
Prince Ning will search everywhere

00:33.040 --> 00:34.480
And find us

00:35.040 --> 00:36.040
By then

00:36.120 --> 00:38.440
Not only will we not be safe

00:38.520 --> 00:40.853
But you will also lose your life

00:42.600 --> 00:44.080
Only if I stay

00:44.600 --> 00:47.120
Will Prince Ning think his trump card remains

00:56.560 --> 00:57.960
Take the prince away

00:58.200 --> 00:59.867
Take good care of him

01:02.160 --> 01:03.560
Thank you

01:33.880 --> 01:36.120
March of the 24th year of Yuankang

01:36.600 --> 01:41.040
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao led a great army to attack the capital Nandu

01:41.120 --> 01:43.040
Facing this northern expedition army

01:43.120 --> 01:45.680
Nandu's defenders were powerless to resist

01:45.920 --> 01:47.320
After one day

01:47.880 --> 01:49.440
Nandu fell

02:04.320 --> 02:05.720
Xie Xuan

02:05.960 --> 02:06.680
Where is your sister?

02:06.760 --> 02:08.160
Where is she?

02:12.440 --> 02:13.840
Where is she?

02:16.320 --> 02:18.653
I'm asking you, where is your sister?

03:26.920 --> 03:27.960
Miss

03:28.040 --> 03:30.040
Why do you look so worried?

03:30.120 --> 03:32.480
Father insists I marry a prince

03:33.120 --> 03:33.840
I know

03:33.920 --> 03:35.440
Father has his reasons

03:35.920 --> 03:38.920
But I've never even met this Prince of Jin

03:39.240 --> 03:41.960
I really don't want to marry so blindly

03:42.560 --> 03:43.680
How about

03:43.760 --> 03:45.427
I write you a note

03:46.800 --> 03:48.200
Owed to my wife

03:48.320 --> 03:49.720
Willow picking at Ba

03:50.280 --> 03:51.800
Flower viewing at Yong'an

03:53.880 --> 03:57.560
Kill

04:05.880 --> 04:07.760
This is just my letter home

04:07.840 --> 04:09.240
Why was it opened?

04:14.240 --> 04:16.720
This edict is fake

04:48.000 --> 04:49.400
First wish

04:50.040 --> 04:51.560
Long live my husband

04:53.120 --> 04:54.520
Second wish

04:55.400 --> 04:57.120
The prince always healthy

04:58.760 --> 05:00.160
Third wish

05:02.000 --> 05:03.880
Become swallows on the beam

05:05.280 --> 05:07.120
Year after year

05:08.360 --> 05:10.080
Always together

05:16.800 --> 05:18.200
Ruolan

05:20.840 --> 05:22.240
Yong'an flowers

05:23.160 --> 05:24.560
This debt

05:25.360 --> 05:27.160
I cannot collect

05:29.120 --> 05:31.320
Ruolan

06:24.040 --> 06:25.760
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao

06:26.120 --> 06:27.080
Seeing me

06:27.240 --> 06:28.640
Why don't you kneel?

06:29.320 --> 06:30.987
Drag him down for me

06:32.920 --> 06:33.400
How dare you

06:33.480 --> 06:34.040
You

06:34.120 --> 06:34.960
You

06:35.040 --> 06:36.440
You

06:45.120 --> 06:46.520
It was you

06:48.160 --> 06:49.827
Who drove Ruolan to death

06:54.160 --> 06:55.560
Sister-in-law

06:55.720 --> 06:56.840
Sister-in-law, to avoid becoming

06:56.920 --> 06:58.480
My leverage against you

06:59.240 --> 07:01.120
Already took her own life first

07:02.200 --> 07:03.480
It was you

07:03.560 --> 07:05.120
Your ambition

07:05.760 --> 07:07.160
Killed her

07:07.840 --> 07:09.080
What?

07:09.160 --> 07:10.960
Thinking how to kill me?

07:11.520 --> 07:13.760
To ease the guilt in your heart?

07:19.040 --> 07:20.440
Let me think

07:20.880 --> 07:22.920
How will historians record you?

07:24.520 --> 07:26.240
Brothers fighting

07:27.120 --> 07:28.760
Killing brother to seize the throne

07:28.920 --> 07:29.840
Yao'er

07:29.920 --> 07:31.320
Yao'er, stop

07:32.280 --> 07:33.560
Yao'er

07:33.640 --> 07:35.280
Yao'er, stop

07:37.120 --> 07:39.760
Your elder brother spared you once

07:39.960 --> 07:41.360
Mother begs you

07:42.160 --> 07:44.040
Spare him this time

07:45.080 --> 07:47.240
You are flesh and blood brothers

07:47.320 --> 07:48.720
Yao'er
